WEBVTT

00:00:01.281 --> 00:00:13.159
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.393 --> 00:00:18.965
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.965 --> 00:00:25.894
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:37.376
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.617 --> 00:00:43.557
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.557 --> 00:00:50.963
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:58.772
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.772 --> 00:01:05.645
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:11.251
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.251 --> 00:01:17.524
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.524 --> 00:01:25.954
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:34.608 --> 00:01:39.545
A SPECIAL PERSON

00:02:06.573 --> 00:02:08.842
Thoma! Where are you going, Thoma?

00:02:08.842 --> 00:02:11.678
That's obvious!
I'm going to bring them back!

00:02:11.678 --> 00:02:15.307
Wait! Helga isn't going to
come back here ever again.

00:02:17.651 --> 00:02:21.822
Do you know why Helga left here
and kept it a secret from you?

00:02:21.822 --> 00:02:23.890
I don't know!

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:26.393
I thought they were my friends.

00:02:26.393 --> 00:02:29.055
I thought I'd be able to help Helga.

00:02:29.129 --> 00:02:31.495
Isn't that right, Mom?!

00:02:38.271 --> 00:02:43.106
Helga left without saying anything
because she was thinking of you.

00:02:45.779 --> 00:02:47.542
Of me?

00:02:53.753 --> 00:02:57.382
Helga didn't want to
destroy your happiness.

00:02:57.657 --> 00:03:01.184
And not just you...
She was thinking of us, too.

00:03:03.697 --> 00:03:08.430
You have a mother and a father,
and you have this place, right?

00:03:08.969 --> 00:03:11.403
But, but you see...

00:03:11.738 --> 00:03:14.901
That girl has no place to call her own.

00:03:15.709 --> 00:03:18.678
A place where she can
smile from her heart.

00:03:19.012 --> 00:03:22.607
And she might be searching
very hard for that.

00:03:27.754 --> 00:03:29.956
You understand, don't you, Thoma?

00:03:29.956 --> 00:03:30.557
It's because she's that kind of girl,

00:03:30.557 --> 00:03:32.025
It's because she's that kind of girl,

00:03:32.025 --> 00:03:34.728
that the happiness of others is
more important to her than most.

00:03:34.728 --> 00:03:36.161
that the happiness of others is
more important to her than most.

00:03:37.264 --> 00:03:39.596
A place to call her own...

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:43.303
It's that place in her drawings!

00:03:43.303 --> 00:03:46.039
Mom, Dad, I...

00:03:46.039 --> 00:03:48.208
I want to do something to help Helga!

00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:50.610
I want to look for that place with her!

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:53.170
You wouldn't listen if we
said "no," would you?

00:04:01.655 --> 00:04:03.790
We understand, Thoma.

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:06.626
But in return, since this is your decision,

00:04:06.626 --> 00:04:09.993
no matter what happens,
don't lose heart! Okay?

00:04:12.265 --> 00:04:14.290
Well, hurry up and get going!

00:04:15.135 --> 00:04:19.572
Thoma! Be careful!

00:04:31.351 --> 00:04:35.310
CHIKAO. HOME FOR CHILDREN

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:43.496
What do you want this
early in the morning?

00:04:43.496 --> 00:04:46.600
We heard that there's a
girl named Helga here.

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:49.831
How are you guys connected to Helga?

00:04:50.103 --> 00:04:52.906
We're her friends...
Old friends.

00:04:52.906 --> 00:04:54.808
Well, that's too bad, isn't it?

00:04:54.808 --> 00:04:58.744
Helga isn't here anymore.
She left all on her own.

00:04:58.912 --> 00:05:01.881
You heard me. Now go home!

00:05:03.783 --> 00:05:04.451
What the...!

00:05:04.451 --> 00:05:06.853
-We're going to look around.
-What did you say?

00:05:06.853 --> 00:05:08.221
When the director isn't here,

00:05:08.221 --> 00:05:10.212
I won't let you just do
whatever you want!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:18.965
This is it!

00:05:18.965 --> 00:05:21.490
This year's transfer record!

00:05:22.702 --> 00:05:24.070
Helga...

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.662
Helga...

00:05:37.917 --> 00:05:39.386
Here she is!

00:05:39.386 --> 00:05:42.219
I-It's this girl.

00:05:47.427 --> 00:05:49.725
Helga... Lui...

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:52.295
Yes...

00:06:01.241 --> 00:06:04.904
This kid... He was on Kokkuri Island!

00:06:09.382 --> 00:06:11.543
She was there!

00:06:32.205 --> 00:06:34.036
Hold on tight!

00:07:25.191 --> 00:07:28.661
Demian... It was him!

00:07:28.661 --> 00:07:32.927
He looks almost exactly the
same as he did 27 years ago.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.126
It's him!

00:08:00.126 --> 00:08:03.892
Professor! Professor Gherta!
We're ready to go!

00:08:09.402 --> 00:08:12.205
Professor! How are you feeling?

00:08:12.205 --> 00:08:14.541
Fine... Well?

00:08:14.541 --> 00:08:18.812
There's been no real change, and
she doesn't seem agitated.

00:08:18.812 --> 00:08:21.372
Really? That's good...

00:08:21.681 --> 00:08:23.850
She trusts us completely,

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.318
and believes she's
going to see her brother.

00:08:26.853 --> 00:08:29.788
It's horrible we have to trick such a girl.

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:36.160
But Professor, how is that guy going
to get to a ship that's out to sea?

00:08:36.429 --> 00:08:38.164
Three years ago during our tests,

00:08:38.164 --> 00:08:42.396
Kirchner gained powers that
we weren't able to understand.

00:08:42.936 --> 00:08:45.769
He disappeared right in front of
my eyes.

00:08:46.873 --> 00:08:49.865
We can't predict how
he's going to get here.

00:08:50.677 --> 00:08:53.771
But for his sister's sake
he will definitely come.

00:08:53.913 --> 00:08:56.549
When he makes contact
with the shield walls,

00:08:56.549 --> 00:08:59.285
bring the high-speed magnetic
fields to full power immediately.

00:08:59.285 --> 00:09:00.386
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:00.386 --> 00:09:03.122
I want him brought in alive,
understood?

00:09:03.122 --> 00:09:04.791
No matter how different he's become,

00:09:04.791 --> 00:09:07.460
don't forget that he's a flesh
and blood human being.

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:11.487
It's not his fault that his body
has become what it has.

00:09:18.671 --> 00:09:20.573
Are there any Etheric Vision readings?

00:09:20.573 --> 00:09:22.508
We're scanning carefully with sonar.

00:09:22.508 --> 00:09:24.344
Will the storm have any effect on it?

00:09:24.344 --> 00:09:26.579
Not at the moment, but...

00:09:26.579 --> 00:09:27.947
Don't worry.

00:09:27.947 --> 00:09:31.084
As long as there's no distortion
in Kirchner's Etheric Body data,

00:09:31.084 --> 00:09:32.881
we'll definitely get a reading.

00:09:37.523 --> 00:09:39.150
The door!

00:09:39.425 --> 00:09:41.518
Hurry! Somebody...

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:46.260
The door! Hurry up!

00:09:50.203 --> 00:09:53.798
It's all right! Professor!
Professor Gherta!

00:10:07.487 --> 00:10:09.785
Professor, are you all right?

00:10:10.123 --> 00:10:12.182
Captain.

00:10:13.026 --> 00:10:16.462
I've had a fear of enclosed spaces
ever since I was a child.

00:10:17.931 --> 00:10:19.990
But I'm all right now.

00:10:20.233 --> 00:10:23.603
Professor, as I recall you're
from German Khartoum, right?

00:10:23.603 --> 00:10:25.434
That's where you were born?

00:10:25.571 --> 00:10:27.440
Until I was eighteen.

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.609
Then I joined the Ged Group,

00:10:29.609 --> 00:10:32.134
and I've been doing research
ever since.

00:10:32.578 --> 00:10:34.314
Khartoum...

00:10:34.314 --> 00:10:37.943
I haven't been back there
for a long time. I miss it.

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:42.215
Captain, what's that?

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:45.959
It's children!

00:10:45.959 --> 00:10:48.261
Captain! We've spotted
a boat on our port-side!

00:10:48.261 --> 00:10:51.297
I know!
Professor, what should we do?

00:10:51.297 --> 00:10:53.466
They'll drown like that.

00:10:53.466 --> 00:10:56.264
It's children!
Rescue them immediately!

00:11:08.548 --> 00:11:11.851
As we thought, she was
with those other kids.

00:11:11.851 --> 00:11:13.953
They might still be close by!

00:11:13.953 --> 00:11:16.217
-Let's split up and search!
-Helga!

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:24.021
Chitto! Helga!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.634
It's that kid!

00:11:30.136 --> 00:11:32.138
They didn't come back?

00:11:32.138 --> 00:11:35.596
If they went out to sea in that
boat... They're in trouble!

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:39.339
It's that statue!

00:11:45.151 --> 00:11:46.743
What?

00:11:59.298 --> 00:12:00.800
You!

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.969
What happened to the girl
that was here?

00:12:02.969 --> 00:12:06.029
Where is she now?!
A girl named Helga!

00:12:16.649 --> 00:12:19.447
Are you deaf? Answer me!

00:12:24.023 --> 00:12:26.192
That's payback for what
you did to me before!

00:12:26.192 --> 00:12:28.227
Are you okay, Tarlant?

00:12:28.227 --> 00:12:29.455
Yeah.

00:12:34.167 --> 00:12:35.964
You guys...

00:12:37.603 --> 00:12:41.240
Helga is a very special person to us.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.576
We have to see her no matter what.

00:12:43.576 --> 00:12:46.909
-Where is she?!
-That's what I want to know!

00:12:48.481 --> 00:12:50.972
Let's go! Follow him!

00:12:58.157 --> 00:13:00.093
Hey! Are your clothes dry?

00:13:00.093 --> 00:13:02.118
Yes! Thank you very much!

00:13:02.528 --> 00:13:07.333
Where were you two going in
a boat like that anyway?

00:13:07.333 --> 00:13:09.802
Were you trying to cross to the
Eastern Mainland or something?

00:13:09.802 --> 00:13:13.473
No, we weren't going anywhere
in particular, it's just...

00:13:13.473 --> 00:13:16.375
Today was such a perfect
day for a boat ride!

00:13:16.375 --> 00:13:18.077
With this weather?

00:13:18.077 --> 00:13:20.913
It wasn't like this when we set out.

00:13:20.913 --> 00:13:23.816
By the way, where is this ship going?

00:13:23.816 --> 00:13:26.419
To Ketplaque Island, part
of the Eastern Mainland.

00:13:26.419 --> 00:13:29.122
But I have to tell you,
this isn't a passenger ship.

00:13:29.122 --> 00:13:30.957
We're in the middle of
an important mission,

00:13:30.957 --> 00:13:34.120
so don't set foot outside the
cabin until you have permission.

00:13:34.327 --> 00:13:36.796
Tomorrow, we're going to the
Eastern Mainland harbor.

00:13:36.796 --> 00:13:39.993
You two will disembark there.
Understood?

00:13:41.767 --> 00:13:45.071
I was right.
I thought I'd seen this boat somewhere,

00:13:45.071 --> 00:13:46.539
this is the boat of the people

00:13:46.539 --> 00:13:48.769
who're looking for the
escaped criminal on Chikao!

00:13:49.175 --> 00:13:51.541
I wonder what their important mission is.

00:14:22.408 --> 00:14:24.273
W-What's that?!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.947
Professor! We're getting
an Etheric Body reading!

00:14:31.717 --> 00:14:34.020
I-It's Kirchner!

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.388
Where is he?

00:14:35.388 --> 00:14:38.050
S-Starboard side, mid-ship,
ten kilometers away!

00:14:40.259 --> 00:14:42.227
He disappeared!

00:14:46.165 --> 00:14:49.362
He's coming. He must be nearby!

00:15:04.617 --> 00:15:06.517
This is Chitto's.

00:15:06.686 --> 00:15:08.551
Helga.

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:13.192
Helga!

00:15:13.192 --> 00:15:15.126
Chitto!

00:15:15.261 --> 00:15:17.821
Helga!

00:15:33.312 --> 00:15:34.973
Wonder!

00:15:53.099 --> 00:15:54.589
Good job, Wonder!

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:00.573
Damn! You jerk! Let go of me!

00:16:00.573 --> 00:16:02.642
Who asked you for help?!

00:16:02.642 --> 00:16:04.610
You're also...

00:16:05.211 --> 00:16:07.736
You're also searching
for Helga, aren't you?

00:16:10.182 --> 00:16:12.912
She's a very special person to us.

00:16:13.619 --> 00:16:17.077
In the same way that
she's special to you.

00:16:18.958 --> 00:16:22.257
You people...
Who are you anyway?!

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:27.228
What do you intend to do to Helga?!

00:16:28.134 --> 00:16:30.329
We'll tell you our reasons later.

00:16:30.603 --> 00:16:32.833
Will you search for her with us?

00:16:33.306 --> 00:16:37.140
Helga! Her boat might
have capsized! Hurry up!

00:16:47.119 --> 00:16:50.748
Wait! Hey! Fly lower!

00:16:50.856 --> 00:16:53.290
Wonder won't respond to your voice.

00:16:53.426 --> 00:16:55.155
Go lower, Wonder!

00:17:12.445 --> 00:17:15.642
Helga... Chitto...

00:17:15.948 --> 00:17:18.314
They were on this?

00:17:23.889 --> 00:17:27.689
Wonder! Take a thermograph of
that boat!

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:43.309
It's Helga and Chitto!

00:17:43.309 --> 00:17:46.579
This will show a thermal afterimage
from up to twelve hours ago.

00:17:46.579 --> 00:17:49.309
Thermal afterimage?

00:17:52.118 --> 00:17:53.881
Someone's rescuing them!

00:17:54.854 --> 00:17:57.948
Wonder! Ascend and search for a ship!

00:18:04.897 --> 00:18:06.694
That's it!

00:18:19.912 --> 00:18:22.676
Where is he? Are there
any Etheric readings?

00:18:26.619 --> 00:18:29.019
N-Not yet! We don't see anything!

00:18:32.358 --> 00:18:34.087
What's that?!

00:18:43.402 --> 00:18:46.098
H-He's here! He's right below us!

00:18:47.606 --> 00:18:49.575
Professor! He's right below the ship!

00:18:49.575 --> 00:18:51.410
Good! Captain!

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:53.612
Until Kirchner enters the shield walls,

00:18:53.612 --> 00:18:55.481
cut all communications onboard ship!

00:18:55.481 --> 00:18:57.972
Roger! All hands are in position!

00:19:00.119 --> 00:19:02.121
Cybele... Don't worry.

00:19:02.121 --> 00:19:04.590
There's a storm outside and
the ship is lurching.

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:07.991
Not much longer. You'll see
your brother very soon.

00:19:13.666 --> 00:19:15.531
Big Brother...

00:19:28.514 --> 00:19:30.607
I wonder what they're doing.

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.656
Helga, you stay here.
I'm going to take a quick look!

00:19:37.656 --> 00:19:39.385
Chitto...

00:19:41.093 --> 00:19:44.756
I wonder what's going on.
There's nobody around...

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.902
I-I'm picking up energy
surges inside the ship!

00:19:49.902 --> 00:19:51.470
What?!

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:53.802
He's already inside the ship?

00:20:20.232 --> 00:20:21.859
Chitto!

00:20:43.355 --> 00:20:44.982
Professor! Look at that!

00:20:48.093 --> 00:20:50.288
Kirchner!

00:20:53.132 --> 00:20:55.434
-Cybele.
-Big Brother!

00:20:55.434 --> 00:20:58.096
You're all right, I'm so glad!

00:20:58.203 --> 00:21:02.606
Cybele... How could I let something
like this happen to you...

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:06.145
Professor!
Give us the signal!

00:21:06.145 --> 00:21:09.081
Not yet!
Be careful with Cybele!

00:21:09.081 --> 00:21:10.716
What are you saying?

00:21:10.716 --> 00:21:15.210
I was told they would let me meet
you, and I've just been waiting.

00:21:15.654 --> 00:21:18.680
And I've met with you again.

00:21:26.398 --> 00:21:27.865
Big Brother...

00:21:31.170 --> 00:21:33.263
Cybele...

00:21:33.472 --> 00:21:36.908
I'm... already...

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:43.380
Don't say it, Big Brother.

00:21:44.817 --> 00:21:47.620
You became like this for me, right?

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:50.389
Come, let's go, Cybele.

00:21:50.389 --> 00:21:51.890
We're leaving here.

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:53.323
Now!

00:22:00.399 --> 00:22:02.424
Seal the shield walls!

00:22:08.641 --> 00:22:11.777
Cybele!

00:22:11.777 --> 00:22:13.438
Big Brother!

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:16.539
Big Brother!

00:22:34.733 --> 00:22:44.540
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:44.943 --> 00:22:54.420
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:59.153
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:22:59.425 --> 00:23:04.260
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:04.496 --> 00:23:13.632
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:14.039 --> 00:23:19.111
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:19.111 --> 00:23:24.016
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:24.016 --> 00:23:28.419
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:28.821 --> 00:23:33.125
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:33.125 --> 00:23:37.994
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
